since the goal of nethack is to retrieve the amulet and escape the dungeon
with it, and perhaps face a final challenge as well, i'd like to suggest a
change that has been broached somewhat before ...

the real amulet ought to be all-powerful and consuming ...

no matter what tricks or stunts you used to get the amulet, when it's in
your possession you should change according to the amulets power:
[some things the amulet should do but doesn't now:]

the amulet should attract monsters to you even if you're invisible. thus
invisibility would be effectively turned into displacement.

the amulet should make all players equally vulnerable by fixing their AC
rating to -30 (improving or reducing it as necessary).

the amulet makes your maximum hit points a constant 300 points.

the amulet gives you all resistances, 2x speed, polymorph and teleport
control, 19 stats across the board (not 18, 19), and the ability to
identify any magic using the <ctrl>-i command.

under its spell you would have amnesia in regards to a given level map
when you re-enter that level. however, with the amulets blessing you
would have knowledge of your local surroundings.

these effects coupled with the current effects of the amulet would make it
respectably powerful and tend to "equalize" the game ending strategies.

